WEBVTT

00:07:28.360 --> 00:07:31.489
because I was burdened
by these personas that I had created

00:07:31.489 --> 00:07:34.283
that were allegedly going to help me
progress in my career.

00:07:34.366 --> 00:07:35.743
I made a couple of mistakes.

00:07:35.743 --> 00:07:38.662
One, I thought that being snarky
was a good career move.

00:07:39.288 --> 00:07:40.289
It wasn’t.

00:07:40.289 --> 00:07:42.458
I also thought I look good
in the color brown.

00:07:42.458 --> 00:07:43.459
I actually don’t.

00:07:43.459 --> 00:07:44.460
(Laughter)

00:07:44.460 --> 00:07:45.461
Yeah.

00:07:45.461 --> 00:07:46.462
(Laughter)

00:07:48.297 --> 00:07:50.216
And, you know, I just --

00:07:50.216 --> 00:07:52.384
in my dream montage,

00:07:52.384 --> 00:07:54.261
I wanted to get away from Bitchy Bevy.

00:07:54.261 --> 00:07:56.263
I wanted to get away from the color brown.

00:07:56.388 --> 00:07:59.141
And so in the movie version of my life,

00:07:59.141 --> 00:08:00.476
as soon as I quit my job,